# text is Sfx.VOICED[hero][kind][index] and its mp3 plays (assets/voice/<hero>_<kind><index + 1>.mp3).
# Zones: head (hair, face), hand (the prop in her hand), outfit (sleeves, shoulders, the outfit's sides),
# bg (the room around her), spam (too many taps in a row), idle (nobody touched anything for a while).
# Lines never point at her body and never talk about the player's gaze (docs/HEROINES.md §4).

